Third-party components of git-secret-guard

git-secret-guard itself is MIT licensed (see LICENSE).

What is in this repository and what is not
------------------------------------------

Only ONE third-party file is vendored here: the husky test fixture, tests/fixtures/husky/h (see "Vendored" below).

Everything else listed here is NOT redistributed in this repository. `git-secret-guard install` downloads it from the
upstream release (or, for git, the upstream source tarball) at install time and verifies the SHA-256 of the download
against tools.lock before anything is placed on the machine. The versions below are the ones pinned in tools.lock.
Each tool keeps its own license; the licenses of the downloaded programs apply to those programs and not to this
repository. Links go to the upstream license files, which are authoritative.

